		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60002","type":"text","text":"# AI-BRAIN Core MCP Runtime\n**Protocol:** MCP 2.0 STDIO JSON-RPC (`ai-brain-mcp`)\n**Storage Engine:** SQLite 3 WAL Mode (`PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;`)\n**Search Backend:** FTS5 BM25 Full-Text Search (`memory_fts`)\n**Database File:** `90_System/db/brain_memory.sqlite`\n\n### Runtime MCP Tools:\n- `brain_search_memory`: Instant sub-5ms BM25 recall\n- `brain_read_memory`: Deep content & metadata retrieval\n- `brain_add_memory`: Autonomous capture & deduplication\n- `brain_memory_stats`: Cognitive layer health & distribution\n- `brain_sync`: Bidirectional markdown-vault to SQLite sync","label":"Central MCP Runtime & Storage Engine","x":-440,"y":-70,"width":460,"height":380,"color":"6"},
